sprites-hard 2026-11-25: scp2774.png = composite of the video's two copies of the same sloth art (no clean web copy; SCP wiki New_Slothman.jpg is a different photo): hi-res face + hood from the mirrored thumbnail https://i.ytimg.com/vi/JUlTxosCXuk/maxresdefault.jpg, SIFT-aligned (scale 0.322) onto the on-board square in maxres1.jpg, which supplies the left hood drape. Board keyed by flood fill up to the black outline, 1px AA, 512px ~92%. The hood's left edge is flat because the art is clipped at its board square in the video.
